    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74222d9230a917c231a7300b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在一些重要的比赛前，会调查网络投票的结果、\r\n再结合专家的建议，发表『赛前人气调查』——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0cfac081d39c00c3c27730ccca4ce6e671206007460525f0d1ab334444b6b07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033201.json",
      "json_path": [
